    tiller_stop_rfr: (value: 1.1, unit: "-", source: "~ WALTer citing Evers 2006: tillering stops at a measured R:FR about 0.35, near GAI 0.5 to 0.6. The sim's proxy, 1.2 exp(-0.5 LAI above the tiller's subtending blade), counts only leaves straight above that blade and none of the far-red reflected sideways by neighbours, so it reads near 1 when a real crown is already shaded; the threshold is set on the proxy so a 200 per m2 stand ends with 2 to 3 ears per plant (decision 0022)"),
